1 REM FBCS PRT-0047
2 REM CLAIM E-1507
3 REM TYPE INPUT
100 REM INPUT UNDERFLOW MAY RAISE NONFATAL 1507 SUPPLYING ZERO (l.12822)
105 REM A USER HANDLER HANDLES IT, SO THE DEFAULT RECOVERY IS NOT APPLIED: A KEEPS ITS VALUE (4.1 L.1360-1368)
108 LET A = 5
110 WHEN EXCEPTION IN
120   INPUT A
130 USE
140   LET H = EXTYPE
150 END WHEN
160 IF H = 1507 AND A = 5 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED: "; H; A
170 END
